      "title": "BRAND NEW Samsung FRIDGE (RS28CB7600QL)\n36 Inch Freestanding Side by Side Smart Refrigerator with 28 cu. ft. Capacity,Beverage Center, Dual Ice Maker, Auto Open Door, Internal Water Dispenser",
      "handle": "brande-new-samsung-fridge-rs28cb7600ql-36-inch-freestanding-side-by-side-smart-refrigerator-with-28-cu-ft-capacity-beverage-center-dual-ice-maker-auto-open-door-internal-water-dispenser",
      "body_html": "<h2 class=\"border-bottom mt2\">Description</h2>\n<div class=\"mb2\"><strong>36 Inch Freestanding Side by Side Smart Refrigerator</strong></div>\n<div class=\"mb2\">\n<br>Samsung's large capacity Side-by-Side Refrigerator with Beverage Center is beautifully designed with a modern look that blends seamlessly into your kitchen and a finish that withstands everyday smudges. The built-in smart connectivity provides temperature controls and monitoring directly from your phone. The fingerprint-resistant finish adds to the beautiful design and the sleek built-in look is sure to be a great fit in any kitchen. All-Around Cooling provides strategic ventilation that efficiently cools all areas of the refrigerator. Bright LED lighting and ADA Compliant controls help make the entire unit easily accessible for everyone.</div>",
